{"parse":{"title":"Miniaturized Detection Sensor","pageid":395718,"revid":1901587,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Miniaturized Detection Sensor</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/35/Talent_Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024358\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Miniaturized Detection Sensor\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/35/Talent_Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024358\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/35/Talent_Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024358 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/3/35/Talent_Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor.png/revision/latest?cb=20250910024358 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Miniaturized Detection Sensor\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Miniaturized_Detection_Sensor.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Miniaturized Detection Sensor.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aino\" title=\"Aino\">Aino</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Passive_Talent\" title=\"Passive Talent\">Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Displays the location of nearby <a href=\"/wiki/Nod-Krai_Local_Specialty\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nod-Krai Local Specialty\">resources unique to Nod-Krai</a> on the mini-map.<br />Additionally, Aino appears to be able to alter the Cool Your Jets Ducky's appearance in some way...</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Resource\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resource\">Resource</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Local_Specialty\" title=\"Local Specialty\">Local Specialty</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Nod-Krai_Local_Specialty\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nod-Krai Local Specialty\">Nod-Krai Local Specialty</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Miniaturized Detection Sensor</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Aino\" title=\"Aino\">Aino</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Utility_Passive\" title=\"Utility Passive\">Utility Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Preview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Preview</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMiniaturized_Detection_Sensor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Aino must be in the active party for Miniaturized Detection Sensor to take effect, but she does not need to be alive.</li>\n<li>Only one local specialty will be shown on the mini-map at a time.</li>\n<li>The following 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Talent\" title=\"Talent\">Talents</a> are identical to this talent:\n<ul><li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Light_in_the_Dark\" title=\"A Light in the Dark\"><img alt=\"A Light in the Dark\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent A Light in the Dark.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_A_Light_in_the_Dark.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Talent_A_Light_in_the_Dark.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250912030126\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Light_in_the_Dark\" title=\"A Light in the Dark\"><img alt=\"A Light in the Dark\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent A Light in the Dark.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_A_Light_in_the_Dark.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/d/dd/Talent_A_Light_in_the_Dark.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250912030126\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/A_Light_in_the_Dark\" title=\"A Light in the Dark\">A Light in the Dark</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Flins\" title=\"Flins\">Flins</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"item talent\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prayers_for_the_Forest\" title=\"Prayers for the Forest\"><img alt=\"Prayers for the Forest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Prayers for the Forest.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1d/Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250910024350\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prayers_for_the_Forest\" title=\"Prayers for the Forest\"><img alt=\"Prayers for the Forest\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Talent Prayers for the Forest.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/1d/Talent_Prayers_for_the_Forest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250910024350\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Prayers_for_the_Forest\" title=\"Prayers for the Forest\">Prayers for the Forest</a></span></span> (<a href=\"/wiki/Lauma\" title=\"Lauma\">Lauma</a>)</li></ul></li>\n<li>Additionally, the appearance of the Cool Your Jets Ducky can be altered by purchasing <a href=\"/wiki/Aino%27s_Toolbox\" title=\"Aino&#39;s Toolbox\">Aino's Toolbox</a> from the <a href=\"/wiki/Workshop%27s_Trove\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Workshop&#39;s Trove\">Workshop's Trove</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Preview\">Preview</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMiniaturized_Detection_Sensor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Talent_Local_Specialty_Map-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Talent_Local_Specialty_Map.png\" title=\"Talent Local Specialty Map.png (77 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/93/Talent_Local_Specialty_Map.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20210820071226\" title=\"Talent Local Specialty Map.png (77 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Talent Local Specialty Map.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Local_Specialty_Map.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Talent Local Specialty Map.png (77 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Talent Local Specialty Map.png\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Local_Specialty_Map.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/93/Talent_Local_Specialty_Map.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20210820071226\" /></a></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FMiniaturized_Detection_Sensor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"4f4aa5a85aac78d4630abfbb927c319f\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:6